00:20:30.000 --> 00:21:06.000
hard for them to get out of. And so we're running experiments now to see if that training process basically helps them unstick. So it sounds like it's becoming both a diagnostic and a therapeutic tool in a sense. And I'm wondering, then are you moving toward, say, identifying people with maybe disordered thinking or violent thoughts and then being able to maybe replace those thoughts with healthier concepts? Yeah. I mean, two things there.

